      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Panda Pintado. Os passos de Spinda são instáveis e cambaleantes, e caminhar por muito tempo faz com que ele passe mal. Cada indivíduo possui um padrão diferente de manchas. Seus movimentos desajeitados, porém, permitem que desvie brilhantemente dos ataques.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo, Humanoide &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/1</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Spinda não possui evoluções conhecidas.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Copycat</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Feint Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Psybeam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Hypnosis</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Dizzy Punch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Sucker Punch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Teeter Dance</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Uproar</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Psych Up</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Double-Edge, Flail</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Thrash</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Brick Break, Calm Mind, Confide, Covet, Double Team, Drain Punch, Dream Eater, Facade, Fire Punch, Fling, Focus Punch, Frustration, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hyper Voice, Ice Punch, Icy Wind, Last Resort, Low Kick, Protect, Psych Up, Psychic, Rain Dance, Recycle, Rest, Return, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Role Play, Round, Safeguard, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snatch, Snore, Stomping Tantrum, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Thief, Thunder Punch, Toxic, Trick, Trick Room, Uproar, Water Pulse, Wild Charge, Work Up, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Assist, Baton Pass, Disable, Encore, Fake Out, Fake Tears, Guard Split, Icy Wind, Psycho Cut, Psycho Shift, Rapid Spin, Role Play, Smelling Salts, Spotlight, Trick, Water Pulse, Wish</p>",
